#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:448
msgid "The addresses and domains of the internet that are used the most. The domain names are learned from the DNS traffic of the router."
msgstr "使用最多的外网地址与域名。域名由路由器的 DNS 流量中学习得到。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:632
msgid "The collector has to be restarted after the settings were changed. A stopped collector does not use any CPU time, the statistics of the last period are still shown."
msgstr "修改设置后需要重启采集器。停止采集器后不再占用 CPU，上一个周期的统计结果仍然保留。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:482
msgid "The collector reads the traffic of the router with a read only packet socket. No firewall rule, route or DNS setting is changed."
msgstr "采集器以只读方式读取路由器上的流量，不会修改任何防火墙规则、路由或 DNS 设置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:435
msgid "The devices with the highest upload and download volume. The router itself is listed as well."
msgstr "上传下载量最高的内网设备，同时包含 OpenWRT 自身。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:494
msgid "The interfaces that face the internet. They provide the total traffic volume and the destination statistics."
msgstr "面向外网的接口，提供总流量和目标地址统计。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic-stats/main.js:487
msgid "The interfaces that face the local network. The traffic of every device is attributed here."
msgstr "面向内网的接口，各台设备的流量都在此统计。"

